          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary">Privacy First</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Your images are processed locally in your browser. Nothing is uploaded to any server. Your privacy is
            guaranteed.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="group rounded-xl border border-surface bg-surface-1 p-5 text-center hover:border-surface-3 transition-all duration-300"
